ue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek引入联想系资本并聘请中信证券启动IPO进程</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic联手Theorem Labs利用Claude完成1.8亿行代码形式化验证</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic将Agent Skills标准捐赠给Linux基金会旗下AAIF</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布智能体计算引擎ACE，为AI智能体提供专属微型虚拟机环境</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ef68ff4c5f582ea687e38f4a06f7efe3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于10月22日正式推出智能体计算引擎（Agent Compute Engine，简称ACE），旨在为AI智能体提供安全、持久且可弹性伸缩的专属计算环境。ACE通过为每个智能体分配硬件隔离的微型虚拟机（microVM），支持智能体执行代码、调用工具及操作浏览器等复杂任务。该环境具备独立的客户内核与根权限，并利用Cloud Hypervisor实现硬件隔离，从源头降低数据外泄风险。ACE的核心优势在于“持久且可暂停”的特性，在20万个智能体的压测中，环境暂停与恢复过程不到500毫秒，大幅提升了单台服务器的智能体承载密度。目前，ACE已服务于Gemini、Gemini平台及Antigravity等项目，开发者后续可通过Google Cloud直接调用，自主管理智能体环境的镜像、身份与生命周期，底层资源调度则由谷歌</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX与特斯拉拟合并，马斯克欲整合汽车火箭与AI业务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ce74afa38ed5795a1b5d3ca55ae39f94.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX与特斯拉已各自成立特别委员会，正式启动合并事宜的讨论。此次合并旨在整合特斯拉的自动驾驶、人形机器人业务与SpaceX的“超级智能”部门及算力基础设施，构建一个涵盖汽车、火箭与AI的综合体。财务数据显示，SpaceX第三季度AI相关营收达75.6亿美元，主要源于算力租赁。双方此前已在Terafab芯片制造及Macrohard AI项目上展开合作。分析指出，合并的核心逻辑在于消除内部利益冲突，通过统一调配英伟达GPU等稀缺资源，加速AI基建布局。此外，该交易将助力马斯克通过换股方式巩固对特斯拉的控制权，并可能触发薪酬方案的提前解锁。若交易达成，预计合并后第四季度资本支出将逼近500亿美元，现有SpaceX股东权益或被大幅稀释。目前，相关方正推动在2027年上半年完成交易交割。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek引入联想系资本并聘请中信证券启动IPO进程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/62b95176ef495da074de7b835cd89d91.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">大模型独角兽DeepSeek近期完成新一轮融资，成功引入君联资本、石溪资本及吉利等多家产业与财务投资者，联想系资本正式进入其股东阵营。在资本动作之外，DeepSeek已于今年9月聘请中信证券担任IPO顾问，最快有望于2027年初推进上市进程。此次融资标志着双方合作从早期的技术适配升级至资本与产业生态深度协同。此前，联想已将DeepSeek模型全面接入其AI PC、服务器及企业AI解决方案中。此次联想系资本的入局，进一步强化了联想AI终端与基础设施业务同头部大模型厂商的绑定，反映出头部AI大模型企业正加速向资本化与产业生态深度融合的新阶段演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic联手Theorem Labs利用Claude完成1.8亿行代码形式化验证</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/913c5611c44d3700de2470664f5bd30d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic与Theorem Labs合作，利用Claude大模型对RISC-V汇编指令及生产级开源代码库进行机器码级别的形式化验证。在数周内，Claude完成了123个开源库、239个测试入口的分析，产出1.8亿行Rocq数学证明代码。该方法将测试入口转译为数学命题，实现了全路径覆盖，成功识别出模糊测试（fuzzing）无法发现的隐秘逻辑漏洞、潜伏十余年的高危死角及x86硬件缺陷。Claude不仅能定位漏洞，还具备自动生成补丁并进行二次验证的能力。目前，该验证效率以约每两个月翻一番的速度增长，首批证明已公开。按此路径，预计投入1.34亿美元即可在2027年底完成Nix生态95%的机器码验证，为软件安全提供了一种将代码正确性转化为数学定理的全新防御范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic将Agent Skills标准捐赠给Linux基金会旗下AAIF</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年10月22日，Anthropic正式将Agent Skills开放标准捐赠给Linux基金会旗下的Agentic AI Foundation（AAIF），旨在推动智能体能力规范的社区化治理。Agent Skills本质上是一套智能体“说明书”，通过包含SKILL.md文件、脚本及模板的文件夹，实现特定任务与领域知识在不同产品间的复用。自2025年12月发布以来，该标准已获ChatGPT、Cursor、GitHub Copilot及VS Code等70多个平台集成，公开技能数量近100万个，累计安装量约2.8亿次。此次捐赠涵盖了标准名称、标志、GitHub组织及agentskills.io域名。Anthropic表示，此举旨在确保该标准保持供应商中立与开放性，使其成为行业公认的通用语言，开发者与企业无需</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
